To run the code open - Codespaces

In Codespaces type following command in terminal
python -m pip install -r requirements.txt

this will install dependencies given in requirement.txt files

In the Codespaces terminal, run:
python download_aifs.py --date 20261021 --hour 00z

This processes forecast steps from 0 to 360 hours at six-hour intervals, creating up to 61 individual NetCDF files and one merged file.
To test the workflow with only three forecast steps first:
python download_aifs.py \
  --date 20261021 \
  --hour 00z \
  --step-start 0 \
  --step-end 12 \
  --step-interval 6

To retain only the merged NetCDF file after processing:
python download_aifs.py \
  --date 20261021 \
  --hour 00z \
  --delete-originals

The last command deletes the individual NetCDF files after merging. Use it only if you are sure you do not need those individual files.
